From c0a14f593293cac18276481220db228e530575d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LibrePods fork <cheongsangchu3414@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:00:29 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Fork: 4 design styles (DataStore), fine-tune & per-device
 profiles, BLE auto-connect

- AppStyle (Toss/Apple/Samsung/Material) on top of the existing Apple/Material
  component families; AA-verified palettes, font scale, high contrast
- FeatureSupport: disable unsupported features with a reason (model, firmware
  report, VendorID hook, premium)
- Precise sliders, 3-band EQ presets, per-AirPods profiles (DataStore)
- AutoConnectController (pure, unit-tested) + AutoConnectManager: edge-triggered
  BLE auto-connect, back-off, pause on user disconnect / takeover, multi-device
  target selection, per-device IRKs; CompanionDeviceService; Android 14 FGS checks
- Home connection status card (name, phase, L/R/case battery with source)

Not compiled: Android SDK unavailable in the build environment.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0116Vt44VWvVjXQogMRNxLC2
